  ['After the Wedding','Preserve dress & bouquet','Medium','Bride'],
  ['After the Wedding','Return rentals','Medium','Both'],
  ['After the Wedding','Start name-change checklist','Medium','Both'],
  ['After the Wedding','Leave reviews for great vendors','Low','Both']
